Hi Isabella,

Are you typing summary() or summary.ctmm()? The former is what you should type on the command line and works for me. The latter is how R internally refers to the S3 method summary for class ctmm, and is what the help files say to distinguish summary of ctmm objects from summary of other objects.

Best,
Chris

